class: negative
summary: an array length the fold refuses is reported once however many passes fold it, at module level, in a signature and in a routine; a shift, `sizeof` of a struct and `alignof` are L0305, since D1321 folds `sizeof` of a scalar alone
program: program.ldn
args: ../tests/fixtures/negative/array-length-refusals-are-reported-once/program.ldn
expect: expected.txt
codes: L0305, L0305, L0305, L0305
constructs: 0520, 0560
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
status: 1
